sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as MessageChainContentComponent
  participant F as ChainFacadeService
  participant T as Tauri bridge
  participant H as Helix chain
  participant G as Go post-chain
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as ChainProjectionStore
  UI->>F: get(chainId,middleCursor,limit,deviceId)
  F->>T: im_post_chain_get
  T->>H: post_chain_get
  H->>G: POST /api/cses/post-chain/get
  G->>PG: ordered TEXT entries read
  G-->>H: entries + window
  H->>DB: PersistAtomic chain_entry/chain_window
  DB-->>H: PersistOk
  H->>B: im:post_chain:upsert
  B->>S: entriesById/textWindowById
  S-->>UI: text-mode / chain-entry-seq / chain-window
  F->>T: im_post_chain_reconcile when mutation outcome unknown
  T->>H: reconcile -> PersistAtomic -> im:post_chain:reconcile
